 project"},{"text":"FEA/CAE project"},{"text":"Manufacturing-oriented design"},{"text":"GD&T engineering drawing"},{"text":"Product-development project"},{"text":"Industrial internship"},{"text":"Final-year capstone"},{"text":"Design calculation documentation"},{"text":"Professional CAD/CAE portfolio"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal graduate profile"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Mechanical Engineering → CAD + GD&T → Machine Design → Manufacturing → FEA → DFM/DFA → Product Development → Internship → Design Portfolio → Design Engineer"}]}]}